      ],
      "outputs": [
        "h"
      ],
      "operation": "./是逐元素除法，.-是逐元素减法。每行用实际a与对应g计算聪明协变量（clever covariate）：a=1为1/g，a=0为-1/(1-g)；允许负方向，不涉及矩阵求逆。",
      "formulaTex": "H_{A,i}=\\frac{A_i}{\\widehat g_i}-\\frac{1-A_i}{1-\\widehat g_i}",
      "dimensions": {
        "a": [
          "n"
        ],
        "g": [
          "n"
        ],
        "h": [
          "n"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
